{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And in it a yellow hair.</b> The place of the hair is harder than the place of smooth flesh, and when it turns yellow, it is known that the flesh has died and weakened." "<b>Thin.</b> The hair too has weakened and thinned from what it was." "<b>Netek.</b> The place of hair is called נתק, because through this the hair becomes detached."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:11:54.688201433Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}